resolution = "The owner rewrite removes the standalone runtime and settlement architecture and uses paxd and committed receipts throughout. Remaining executor names appear only in the explicitly pre-merge retirement paragraph; retained witness/codec material is labeled historical and supplies no current settlement step. No missing expected README fact was found during implementation review; gate evidence determines qualification."
